{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin 数"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 数”"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对所有序列 $I=(i_1,\\cdots,i_k)$, 考虑 [Pontryagin 类](Pontryagin 类.md) $p_I=p_{i_1}\\cdots p_{i_k}$, Pontryagin 数可视为映射\n$$\r\np_I\\colon \\Omega \\to\\mathbb Z,\r\n[M]\\mapsto \\left&lt;p_I(M),[M]\\right&gt;,\r\n$$\n因为它是"},{"Local":{"url":"配边","text":"配边"}},{"Plain":"不变量.</p>\n"}]}}